_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQoZaRG00zNY7W92HXRVXfulB0uwgnSt8jI8kOvBy9hkg&oe=6B0DBDC8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440Sample1.png", "id": "1043186225467492", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839668_1043186228800825_2212586140831461112_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e7kIhozewcMQ7kNvwHZnJW3&_nc_oc=AdpRLIJtMhtHQ36hDDUkF_S9GrVIklhG0wXZJJDTBvuK-DvxjtCyzZg-U7McidhoOc8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQStPtBEDTRQEq8KG0FZ2iZbOE0s8GSfGi6Tkc9nxDXbiA&oe=6B0DB3EA"}, "display_name": "Battle Horde", "keywords": ["Horde", "Zombies", "Shooter", "Survival", "Weapons"], "long_description": "# Alone.\n\n**Fighting for your life.**\n\nAgainst a relentless and unknown enemy.\n\n**Battle** the **Horde** in a fast paced shooter where simply *surviving* the onslaught of enemies is the primary goal.  \n\nAdvance through multiple levels on your way to freedom.  Earn unlock points for completing each level.  Use the points to unlock additional perks, weapons, and explosives to try your hand at **Hard** mode.\n\nMake your way through all the levels to unlock **The Arena**, where endless waves await your destructive power!  Or.. is it the other way around?\n\n***\n\n**Early Access:**   Battle Horde is in early access.  There is a short campaign, with unlocks for weapons, gear, and an endless mode.\n\n**The Arena** is being worked on for additional challenges.", "short_description": "Fight and Escape, in Battle Horde!\n\nBattle the fast moving onslaught of Horde enemies on your way to freedom."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://games8ten.com/app-game-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Games 8 Ten Inc", "support_website_url": "https://games8ten.com/horde-invasion-support/", "website_url": "https://games8ten.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comf